# Safety net. Runtime state (auth.json, history.jsonl, log/, sessions/)
# should never land here: Codex reads and writes runtime state under
# ~/.codex (bind-mounted from /srv/devhome/.codex), not in this repo dir.
# The files in this directory are symlinked into ~/.codex at container
# post-create; Codex then follows the symlinks for config/prompts/skills/
# agents only. If any runtime-state file nevertheless appears here, this
# .gitignore keeps it out of commits — treat its presence as a bug and
# investigate why codex wrote here instead of ~/.codex.
auth.json
auth.*.json
history.jsonl
log/
sessions/
themes/
cache/
tmp/
state/
